  "rules": [
    "Design flags balance the frozen portfolio and are not expected result labels.",
    "QG-0 is recorded only when no content, evidence, or product repair is proposed.",
    "Every non-QG-0 gap has one primary code, one recurrence key, one owner rationale, and one disposition.",
